  "task_id": "2026-10-04-watchlist-pod-scope",
  "owner": "user",
  "goal": "The Pods card and the cluster readiness deficit must count only active Pods that match the current watchlist, the same set the Pods tab already shows. A not-ready Pod outside that set must not change the card, must not move the cluster to Watch, and must not send a Health State Shift Alert. A Pod that matches more than one watch target is counted once. A not-ready Pod that does match still counts. An empty watchlist still shows the existing configuration-required state and does not become a healthy zero-pod cluster. Nodes, Warning Events, completed-Job handling, and the startup grace stay unchanged.",
  "acceptance": [
    {
      "id": "A1",
      "assertion": "A not-ready Pod that matches no current watch target is excluded from PodSummary, and the watched target stays OK.",
